      "value": "<h1>Deployment Runbook</h1><p>How to ship a release to production safely.</p><h2>Pre-flight Checklist</h2><ul><li>All tests green on main</li><li>Changelog updated</li><li>On-call engineer notified</li></ul><h2>Deploy Steps</h2><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"code\" ac:schema-version=\"1\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"language\">bash</ac:parameter><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[make release TAG=v1.2.3\nmake deploy ENV=production]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>"
